<title>JAPAN: Ricoh - 96/97 group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Ricoh - 96/97 group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.32 trln	 vs	    1.11 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   83.36		vs	   55.38</p>
<p> Current	     64.72		vs	   49.54</p>
